                %em Fibered derivators, (co)homological descent, and Grothendieck’s six functors
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a{:href => "http://home.mathematik.uni-freiburg.de/hoermann/overview6fu.pdf"} pdf
              %p
                %em> Fibered Multiderivators and (co)homological descent
                ,
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1505.00974"} arxiv./1505.00974
              %p
                %em Six Functor Formalisms and Fibered Multiderivators
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.02146"} arXiv:1603.02146
              %p
                %em Derivator Six Functor Formalisms — Definition and Construction I
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.02152"} arXiv:1701.02152
          %p
            Formalization of six functor formalism in
            = succeed ":" do
